(7636935, 1239156, 67145, '<td valign="top">i saw this first on my phone .. and loved it .. <br/>on my computer i have come back to it a couple of times .. <br/>i dont know exactly what it is about this that i find enchanting and moving .. <br/>visually its so appealing .. the leaves hanging down forming the shadow .. like a meeting .. and the interesting patterns on the ground with a silver sheen ... i like how the water runoff enters .. goes under the leaves and into the shadow .. then leaves or departs .. two leaves can be confusing .. lol .. but its like it makes a detour .. this is excellent .. :)</td>', 'i saw this first on my phone .. and loved it .. on my computer i have come back to it a couple of times .. i dont know exactly what it is about this that i find enchanting and moving .. visually its so appealing .. the leaves hanging down forming the shadow .. like a meeting .. and the interesting patterns on the ground with a silver sheen ... i like how the water runoff enters .. goes under the leaves and into the shadow .. then leaves or departs .. two leaves can be confusing .. lol .. but its like it makes a detour .. this is excellent .. :)', '2019-08-02 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
